# Beastmaster's native cue check, updated for the accepted #215 pack kit.
# Design 8423ac38, kit fa500819, damage a7fdfa77; full pack forms: 215/pack.pad.
# Beastmaster a against Beastmaster b; syntax and checks: smashcraft:docs/native-bot-session.md.
# A side special from standing starts a dash too, so each one slides its caster about 151 (7bc2877cdb).
#! chat -dev quick hero beastmaster
# b dashes right and summons its bear, then commands it right; the command's 360-frame cooldown
# (5d2f3ee9b3) refuses a second one, so b runs back left from 185 to 200 instead, keeping
# the fight clear of the right edge, where Bear's kill-class maul (3c18b4ff6e) would carry b off.
40 b stick 1 0
42 b stick 0 0
# a summons Quilbeast, then commands its volley from the air.
50 a stick 0 -1
50 a tap X 2
51 a stick 0 0
52 a capture
60 b stick 1 0
60 b tap X 2
61 b stick 0 0
68 a capture
100 a tap B 8
106 a stick 0 -1
106 a tap X 2
107 a stick 0 0
108 a capture
124 a capture
130 b stick 1 0
130 b tap X 2
131 b stick 0 0
# a summons its bear, then runs up to b with the bear following, stopping on 236.
165 a stick 1 0
165 a tap X 2
166 a stick 0 0
167 a capture
185 b stick -1 0
195 a capture
200 b stick 0 0
225 a stick 1 0
236 a stick 0 0
# a jabs; the jab holds him through 330, so he commands Stampede from standing on 332,
# not mid-dash: from a run, 7bc2877cdb's traction slides him off the right edge.
# The three lizards spawn on command frames 2, 5 and 8 (3c18b4ff6e); two reach b, on 333
# and 336, for 0.5 each (c2f55b27bf), and the Bear's 10-damage maul lands on 349.
310 a tap A 2
314 a capture
332 a stick 1 0
332 a tap X 2
333 a stick 0 0
336 a capture
338 a capture
349 a capture
# This volley press is early: Stampede still runs through frame 363.
360 a stick 0 -1
360 a tap X 2
361 a stick 0 0
362 a capture
364 a capture
# a runs left and throws Wild Axes; the second press cannot replace live axes.
390 a stick -1 0
# b lands back on stage after the maul, summons Hawk, then commands its grounded dives.
415 a stick 0 0
430 a tap X 2
432 a capture
440 b stick -0.4 1
440 b tap X 2
441 b stick 0 0
450 a capture
480 a tap B 8
486 a tap X 2
488 a capture
# View held a second: the first of two moments the parity check replays.
500 a press VIEW
506 a capture
530 b stick -0.4 1
530 b tap X 2
531 b stick 0 0
# a: Summon Hawk on the ground; the airborne lift is covered by 215/pack.pad.
550 a stick 0 1
550 a tap X 2
551 a stick 0 0
552 a capture
560 a capture
570 a release VIEW
